## Последний milestone в main

Phase 19 Doc02 audit recovery **K2 PASS** (PR #84): fresh ABBA gives 1ch 50.0
fps and 3ch 50.0/50.0/50.0, worst paired uplift 1.5748× with zero
late/drop/flush/unlock. PR7 AVX2, PR8 dirty/cache/ownership and PR9 allowlist
hardening are implemented. Global flag stays OFF; opt-in is the explicit
template-id allowlist. Final 15m 1ch and 60m 3ch soaks pass at 50.0 fps with
zero DeckLink delivery errors.

Phase 20 P20.1/M0 instrumentation готово: FrameLog v2, runtime/DeckLink
provenance, semantic marker, operator marks и joint analysis. Internal
`one_tick` устранил `(2,0)` logical cadence, но loopback L1 и complex `test1`
доказали, что residual on-wire duplicates и визуальные микрофризы остаются.

## Следующие задачи

- Phase 20 P20.2 — merge hardened loopback tooling and obtain repeatable clean
  5–15-minute semantic-field evidence.
- Phase 20 P20.3 — correct BeginFrame/CEF-paint wait identity, then test the
  absolute 20-ms field grid as a separate factor.
- Phase 20 P20.4/P20.5 — calibrate residual microfreeze detector on
  `p20-test1-marker`, select a causal mitigation and complete 3ch visual soaks.

